<title>UK: SNAP Ltd sets 75 mln mark repackaged MinFin bond.</title>
<headline>SNAP Ltd sets 75 mln mark repackaged MinFin bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager ING Bank NV.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SNAP CAYMAN LTD</p>
<p> AMT    75 MLN DEM    COUPON     7.75	MATURITY    28.MAY.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.625   PAY DATE  S-14.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    99.875    SPREAD	+445 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OBL 6.125 PCT DUE MAY 1999</p>
<p> NOTES	REPACKAGED RUSSIA MINFIN 3</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
